          "why_rejected": "Searched using terms 'menopause status postmenopausal' but results were above-threshold for medication questions rather than menopause status classification.",
          "exposes_the_estimate_to": "Bias due to uncontrolled menopause status, which is closely tied to the exposure mechanism through oophorectomy-induced menopause."
        }
